{"parentUuid":"2f9e76af-95e1-4a3b-8728-753e133a9808","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeZ2eHd3e7S7JBTLvdVDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NHf91GHsJeyFe1yLh5tDN9","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/dimakhaver/programming/EnderTuring/rbac-fastapi-task/CLAUDE.md","content":"# RBAC task — project rules\n\nHiring test task: add RBAC (admin/manager/member) to this full-stack-fastapi-template clone.\nSpec: ../task-spec/README.md. Graded on readability, security-gap-free RBAC, focused tests,\ndocs, and commit history. No gold-plating.\n\n## Commands (canonical — do not improvise)\n- Services: `docker compose up -d db mailpit`\n- Backend tests: `cd backend && uv run bash scripts/test.sh` (ONLY test entrypoint; never root scripts/test.sh)\n- Run app: `cd backend && uv run bash scripts/prestart.sh && uv run fastapi dev`\n- Lint: `uv run prek run --all-files` — must pass before EVERY commit (mypy strict + ty)\n\n## Decisions (final — do not relitigate; record in docs)\n- Single `role` enum column on User (admin|manager|member); `role` is the sole source of\n  truth for authorization. Keep `is_superuser` for template compatibility only.\n- Migration: server_default='member'; explicit Postgres enum create/drop; data migration\n  is_superuser=true → role=admin.\n- 401 = missing/invalid credentials; 403 = authenticated but not permitted. Never mix.\n- Log every denial: logger.warning with user id + route.\n- Public /signup stays open, assigns role=member.\n\n## Permission matrix (implement exactly)\n| Action | admin | manager | member |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| List users | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| Create user (admin endpoint) | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| Update/delete any user | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| GET /metrics/summary (stub) | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| GET/PUT /settings (stub) | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| Own profile view/update | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n\n## Process\n- Conventional commits, one per milestone, prek green first try.\n- TDD: failing role×endpoint test shown first, then implement, then show green.\n- Ask before any scope expansion; record scope cuts in NOTES.md.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":208,"cache_read_input_tokens":32561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":208,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CeZ2eGgVUrHNH7EDaXWn3","type":"assistant","uuid":"1b2a2854-9612-483b-a41e-d672e2fcccf5","timestamp":"2026-08-30T13:41:41.670Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dimakhaver/programming/EnderTuring/rbac-fastapi-task","sessionId":"4a1f3817-2385-4e23-95d7-028e997c9847","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch":"master","slug":"jaunty-dancing-liskov"}
