ded navigation** instead of\n  reading the React Query cache — one extra small request on entering a guarded\n  route, in exchange for keeping the guard self-contained.\n- **No Playwright/e2e coverage.** Frontend verification is lint + typecheck + build;\n  authorization itself is covered by the backend test matrix.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5934a2c6-8ceb-4120-911c-b5d42207f97c","userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dimakhaver/programming/EnderTuring/rbac-fastapi-task","sessionId":"4a1f3817-2385-4e23-95d7-028e997c9847","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch":"feature/rbac","slug":"jaunty-dancing-liskov"}
