{"parentUuid":"93247af6-576c-409c-b509-eee1ed63aa0a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeZ9jbrcdjrj523xyKNyJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01McvFzzL3ajX437YiXy4p8V","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"gh pr create --base master --head feature/rbac --title \"feat: role-based access control (admin/manager/member)\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nAdds RBAC with three roles — `admin`, `manager`, `member` — enforced on the backend via a single declarative dependency, mirrored in the frontend for UX only.\n\n- Single `role` enum column on `User` (Postgres enum, `server_default='member'`, data migration `is_superuser=true → admin`) as the sole source of truth\n- Central role→permission mapping in `backend/app/api/permissions.py`; routes guarded with the `require_roles(*roles)` factory in `deps.py` — no inline role checks\n- New stub endpoints exercising the matrix: `GET /metrics/summary` (admin+manager), `GET/PUT /settings/` (admin)\n- Frontend: role-aware nav, `beforeLoad` route guards, `/forbidden` page, `/metrics` page; managers see the users list read-only\n- Every denial logged with user id + route; strict 401 (missing/invalid credentials) vs 403 (authenticated but forbidden)\n\n## Permission matrix\n\n| Action | admin | manager | member |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| List users (`GET /users/`) | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| Read any user (`GET /users/{id}`) | ✓ | ✓ | self only |\n| Create user (`POST /users/`) | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| Update/delete any user | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| `GET /metrics/summary` | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ |\n| `GET/PUT /settings/` | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| Own profile (`/users/me`) | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ |\n\nPublic `POST /users/signup` stays open and always assigns `member`; `UserUpdateMe`/`UserRegister` exclude `role`, so self-escalation is impossible.\n\n## Design docs\n\n- `docs/adr/001-role-model.md` — why a single enum column (adding a role touches ≤3 files)\n- `docs/adr/002-frontend-capability-propagation.md` — frontend checks are UX only\n- `NOTES.md` — deliberate scope cuts (`is_superuser` kept for template compat, in-memory settings stub, no e2e)\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `uv run bash scripts/test.sh` — 87 passed (parametrized role×endpoint matrix in `tests/api/routes/test_rbac.py`, incl. allowed+denied per path, unauthenticated/invalid-token 401, self-escalation, signup role)\n- [x] Migration round-trip (upgrade/downgrade) + `is_superuser → admin` backfill verified against Postgres\n- [x] Live curl matrix against the running app: 200/403 per role and 401 without/with invalid token on `/users/`, `/metrics/summary`, `/settings/`; denial log lines confirmed\n- [x] `uv run prek run --all-files` green (mypy strict + ty); frontend lint + build green\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Create PR from feature/rbac to master"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":186,"cache_read_input_tokens":66937,"output_tokens":1166,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":186,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CeZ9jW5rGvXBaW61nafJU","type":"assistant","uuid":"f9d8116f-a404-4b1a-8cee-777894abe130","timestamp":"2026-08-30T15:14:43.815Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dimakhaver/programming/EnderTuring/rbac-fastapi-task","sessionId":"4a1f3817-2385-4e23-95d7-028e997c9847","version":"2.1.74","gitBranch":"feature/rbac","slug":"jaunty-dancing-liskov"}
